<title>USA: CACI Intl acquires Sunset Resources.</title>
<headline>CACI Intl acquires Sunset Resources.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>CACI International Inc said on Tuesday that it has acquired the business and most of the assets of Sunset Resources Inc for $5.3 million.</p>
<p>CACI said it expects the acquisition to be non-dilutive to earnings.</p>
<p>SRI, headquartered in San Antonio, Texas, is an engineering and information technology firm with annual revenues of about $12 million.</p>
</text>
